#: src/views/ConfigurationJoystickView.vue
msgid ""
"It seems like you're running versions of Mavlink2Rest (BlueOS) and/or "
"ArduPilot that do not support the extended MAVLink MANUAL_CONTROL message. "
"We strongly suggest upgrading both so you can have support for additional "
"buttons and axes on the joystick. This is especially important if you "
"sometimes use other control station software, like QGroundControl, as "
"Cockpit can preferentially use the extended buttons to reduce configuration "
"clashes. We recommend using BlueOS ≥ 1.2.0, and ≥ version 4.1.2 for "
"ArduPilot-based autopilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"看起来您运行的 Mavlink2Rest（BlueOS）和/或 ArduPilot 版本不支持扩展的 MAVLink MANUAL_CONTROL "
"消息。我们强烈建议将两者都升级，以便支持摇杆上更多的按钮和轴。如果您有时使用其他控制站软件（如 QGroundControl），这一点尤为重要，因为 "
"Cockpit 可以优先使用扩展按钮以减少配置冲突。我们建议使用 BlueOS ≥ 1.2.0，以及基于 ArduPilot 的自动驾驶仪固件 ≥ "
"4.1.2 版本。"

