"On the water it drifts with the wind and current until the autopilot is "
"back, and Cockpit shows no telemetry for it meanwhile."
msgstr "在水面上，它会随风和水流漂移，直到自动驾驶仪恢复，在此期间 Cockpit 不会显示其遥测数据。"

#: src/views/ConfigurationLogsView.vue
msgid ""
"On this screen, you can configure the telemetry data that will be displayed "
"on the subtitle file for recorded videos. You can change the font size, "
"color, and style, as well as the position of each variable on the screen. "
"You can also add custom messages that will be displayed on the video player "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"在此界面中，您可以配置录制视频字幕文件中所显示的遥测数据。您可以更改字号、颜色和样式，以及各变量在屏幕上的位置。您还可以添加将在视频播放器界面显示的自定"
"义消息。"

