#: src/views/ConfigurationMissionView.vue
msgid ""
"Once the limit is reached, the last third of the mission trail will be "
"simplified. Keep this value reasonable — larger histories use more memory "
"and may affect performance over long missions, specially when using DVL or "
"RTK positioning data."
msgstr ""
"达到上限后，任务轨迹的最后三分之一将被简化。请将此值设置合理——历史记录越大，占用内存越多，并可能在长时间任务中（尤其是使用 DVL 或 RTK "
"定位数据）影响性能。"

